        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Mirce">Mirc.</ref> 1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ceorles wergild is on Myrcna lage CC scill'.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">In the law of the Mercians a ceorl's wergild is 200 shillings</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ceorles wergyld is on Myrcna lage CC scill'.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryTranslation" xml:lang="en">According to the law of the Mercians, a layman's wergild is two hundred shillings.</ab>
